## Forwards the meeting whiteboard queries and mutations (listMeetingWhiteboards,
## getMeetingWhiteboard, listMeetingWhiteboardVersions, createMeetingWhiteboard,
## updateMeetingWhiteboard, deleteMeetingWhiteboard, updateCallWhiteboards,
## requestWhiteboardUpdate, and the meeting playbooks' applyMeetingPlaybook and
## meetingPlaybookOptions) to the meeting whiteboards Lambda: the arguments,
## the verified identity and the field name, which is what the Lambda's access
## check reads. VTL rather than APPSYNC_JS so the mutations can answer through
## dDbPutCondition.response.vtl, which writes SharedWith in the form the
## onMeetingWhiteboard and onUpdateCall subscription filters match.
{
  "version": "2018-05-29",
  "operation": "Invoke",
  "payload": {
    "arguments": $util.toJson($ctx.arguments),
    "identity": $util.toJson($ctx.identity),
    "info": { "fieldName": $util.toJson($ctx.info.fieldName) }
  }
}
